      "content": "I'm a bit worried though. I was looking through the legal filings this morning and saw the notice about the pending challenge on that data processing patent. If Nebula's lawyers catch wind of that during the due diligence phase, it could tank the whole deal or at least drop our valuation way below the $1.2B mark. \n\nHow should we handle this specific legal nuance during the presentation? Should we bring it up proactively to build trust, or is there a better way to position it so it doesn't derail our target?",
